# The generated orchestrator and the skill files are read on Linux, macOS and
# Windows, and shipped to three harnesses plus a marketplace clone. Windows
# clones default to core.autocrlf=true, so the same commit produced LF in the
# repo and CRLF in the plugin cache. Pin the working tree to LF everywhere
# rather than relying on each machine core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
